        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Celabrasion, Thank You, Happy Birthday, Shake Me Down\n- People: Jay Joyce\n- Companies: Mom + Pop Music\n- Organizations: Sleeper Agent, Cage the Elephant\n- Roles: record producer, songwriter, session musician\n\nFacts:\n- Celabrasion is the debut album by the American rock band Sleeper Agent.\n- Celabrasion was produced by Jay Joyce.\n- Celabrasion was released digitally on iTunes on August 2, 2011, via Mom + Pop Music.\n- Celabrasion was released physically on September 27, 2011.\n- Jay Joyce is John Joseph \"Jay\" Joyce, an American record producer, songwriter, and session musician.\n- Jay Joyce produced the album Thank You, Happy Birthday.\n- Jay Joyce also produced Cage the Elephant's eponymous debut album.\n- Shake Me Down is the first single and fourth track on Cage the Elephant's second album Thank You, Happy Birthday.",
